<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>UniSphere - Email Verification</title>
</head>

<body style="
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  background-color: #f1f5f9;
  font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
">

  <!-- Main Wrapper -->

  <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
    style="
      background-color: #f1f5f9;
      padding: 40px 15px;
    ">

```
<tr>
  <td align="center">

    <!-- Email Container -->
    <table width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
      style="
        max-width: 600px;
        width: 100%;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 18px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 35px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
      ">

      <!-- ================= HEADER ================= -->
      <tr>
        <td align="center"
          style="
            background-color: #2563eb;
            padding: 38px 25px;
          ">

          <!-- Logo -->
          <div style="
            width: 70px;
            height: 70px;
            margin: 0 auto 16px auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 50%;
            text-align: center;
            line-height: 70px;
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #2563eb;
            border: 4px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.30);
          ">
            U
          </div>

          <!-- Brand Name -->
          <h1 style="
            margin: 0;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
          ">
            UniSphere
          </h1>

          <p style="
            margin: 8px 0 0 0;
            color: #dbeafe;
            font-size: 14px;
          ">
            Your University. Your Future.
          </p>

        </td>
      </tr>


      <!-- ================= CONTENT ================= -->
      <tr>
        <td style="
          padding: 42px 40px 35px 40px;
        ">

          <!-- Title -->
          <h2 style="
            margin: 0 0 15px 0;
            color: #0f172a;
            font-size: 25px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-align: center;
          ">
            Verify Your Email
          </h2>

          <!-- Greeting -->
          <p style="
            margin: 0 0 16px 0;
            color: #475569;
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            text-align: center;
          ">
            Hello
            <strong style="color: #0f172a;">
              <%= name %>
            </strong>,
          </p>

          <!-- Description -->
          <p style="
            margin: 0;
            color: #64748b;
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            text-align: center;
          ">
            Welcome to <strong style="color: #2563eb;">UniSphere</strong>.
            Thank you for creating your account.
            Please use the verification code below to complete your registration.
          </p>


          <!-- ================= OTP CARD ================= -->
          <div style="
            margin: 32px 0;
            padding: 26px 20px;
            background-color: #eff6ff;
            border: 1px solid #dbeafe;
            border-radius: 14px;
            text-align: center;
          ">

            <!-- OTP Label -->
            <p style="
              margin: 0 0 14px 0;
              color: #64748b;
              font-size: 12px;
              font-weight: 700;
              text-transform: uppercase;
              letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            ">
              Your Verification Code
            </p>

            <!-- OTP -->
            <div style="
              display: inline-block;
              padding: 13px 28px;
              background-color: #ffffff;
              border: 2px dashed #2563eb;
              border-radius: 10px;
            ">

              <span style="
                color: #2563eb;
                font-size: 32px;
                font-weight: 700;
                letter-spacing: 8px;
              ">
                <%= otp %>
              </span>

            </div>

          </div>


          <!-- ================= EXPIRATION ================= -->
          <div style="
            margin-bottom: 22px;
            padding: 14px 16px;
            background-color: #fff7ed;
            border-left: 4px solid #f97316;
            border-radius: 8px;
          ">

            <p style="
              margin: 0;
              color: #9a3412;
              font-size: 13px;
              line-height: 1.6;
              text-align: center;
            ">
              ⏱️ This verification code will expire in
              <strong>
                <%= expirtionSeconds %> minutes
              </strong>.
            </p>

          </div>


          <!-- ================= SECURITY ================= -->
          <div style="
            padding: 18px;
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            border-radius: 10px;
            text-align: center;
          ">

            <p style="
              margin: 0;
              color: #64748b;
              font-size: 13px;
              line-height: 1.7;
            ">
              🔒 If you did not create a UniSphere account,
              you can safely ignore this email.
              <br>
              Never share your verification code with anyone.
            </p>

          </div>

        </td>
      </tr>


      <!-- ================= FOOTER ================= -->
      <tr>
        <td style="
          background-color: #f8fafc;
          padding: 28px 25px;
          border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
          text-align: center;
        ">

          <!-- Footer Logo -->
          <div style="
            width: 38px;
            height: 38px;
            margin: 0 auto 10px auto;
            background-color: #2563eb;
            border-radius: 50%;
            line-height: 38px;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 17px;
            font-weight: bold;
          ">
            U
          </div>

          <!-- Footer Brand -->
          <p style="
            margin: 0;
            color: #334155;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 700;
          ">
            UniSphere
          </p>

          <p style="
            margin: 6px 0 0 0;
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-size: 12px;
          ">
            University Management Platform
          </p>

          <p style="
            margin: 10px 0 0 0;
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-size: 11px;
          ">
            © <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> UniSphere.
            All rights reserved.
          </p>

        </td>
      </tr>

    </table>

  </td>
</tr>
```

  </table>

</body>

</html>
